1
00:05:15,789 --> 00:05:21,789
When the last angel falls, the fight for mankind begins.

2
00:10:31,578 --> 00:10:37,578
Legion is a action, fantasy, horror film directed by Scott Stewart.

3
00:15:47,368 --> 00:15:53,368
When God loses faith in humankind, he sends his legion
of angels to bring on the Apocalypse.

4
00:21:03,157 --> 00:21:09,157
Humanity's only hope for survival lies in a group of strangers trapped in
an out-of-the-way, desert diner with the Archangel Michael.

5
00:26:18,947 --> 00:26:24,947
Michael, played by Paul Bettany.

6
00:31:34,736 --> 00:31:40,736
Bob Hanson, played by Dennis Quaid.

7
00:36:50,526 --> 00:36:56,526
Jeep Hanson, played by Lucas Black.

8
00:42:06,315 --> 00:42:12,315
Sandra Anderson, played by Kate Walsh.

9
00:47:22,105 --> 00:47:28,105
Kyle Williams, played by Tyrese Gibson.

10
00:52:37,894 --> 00:52:43,894
Charlie, played by Adrianne Palicki.

11
00:57:53,684 --> 00:57:59,684
Legion is a 2010 American action horror film directed by Scott
Stewart and co-written by Stewart and Peter Schink.

12
01:03:09,473 --> 01:03:15,473
The film stars Paul Bettany, Lucas Black, Tyrese Gibson,
Adrianne Palicki, Kate Walsh, and Dennis Quaid.

13
01:08:25,263 --> 01:08:31,263
Sony Pictures Worldwide Acquisitions Group acquired most of the film's worldwide distribution rights,
releasing the film theatrically in North America on January 22, 2010 through Screen Gems.

14
01:13:41,052 --> 01:13:47,052
A story of the Second Coming, Legion follows a group of people as they attempt to
protect an infant savior from angels and the possessed in an apocalypse.

15
01:18:56,842 --> 01:19:02,842
Legion was released to negative critical reception but was a success at the
box office, earning over $67 million on a $26 million budget.

16
01:24:12,631 --> 01:24:18,631
A television series titled Dominion, set 25 years after the film, premiered on
the American cable television network Syfy on June 19, 2014.

17
01:29:28,421 --> 01:29:34,421
The film explores themes of angel, supernatural, diner, religion, apocalypse.

18
01:34:44,210 --> 01:34:50,210
The tone is uplifting and dark.
